<title>MEXICO: U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Nov 20.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Nov 20.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Soybean Association updated Tuesday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico.</p>
<p>Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the marketing year Sept 1 - Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending    Accum Total    Week Ending    Accum Total</p>
<p>    18/10/96	    182,100	19/10/95	   292,200</p>
<p>    24/10/96	    265,700	24/10/95	   N/A</p>
<p>    30/10/96	    351,000	01/11/95	   365,700</p>
<p>    06/11/96	    405,000	08/11/95	   382,700</p>
<p>    11/11/95	    503,000	16/11/95	   480,500</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
</text>
